  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can open temporary conduits to watery destinations. As a Magic action, you teleport yourself and up to five other willing creatures you can see within 30 feet of you. Amid a whirl of tentacles, you all vanish and reappear up to 1 mile away in a body of water you've seen (pond size or larger) or within 30 feet of it, each in an unoccupied space within 30 feet of the others. Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or Long Rest.</p>",
